From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 02:40:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Zeppelin F-223: extension seams for the WXL ports

- ItemScript::OnScalingStatArmor at the end of GetScalingStatArmor (0x0061A6B0)
- TerrainScript::OnTerrainTileFile in CMap::LoadArea (tile ADT path rewrite)
- WorldScript::OnMinimapTileDirectory in MinimapBuildSource, base-tile fallback
- MinimapForceTileReload() and CMap::RequestAreaReload(x, y): reload through
  the engine's own paths instead of re-running CMap::Load

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ByrZ7GxoHC9wfGdkRwtqCX
