+
+    // MinimapBuildSource (WoW/Source/Ui/MinimapFrame.cpp), before the md5translate lookup of one
+    // minimap tile: directory is the Map.dbc directory of the minimap's map, used to form the key
+    // "<directory>\\map<x>_<yy>.blp". A script may point it at another directory (a terrain phase's
+    // art); when that key has no md5translate row the client falls back to the map's own directory,
